				"A cinematic dialogue sequence on the way back, set on a classic British street at night after rain. Wet cobblestone pavement, old brick and stone buildings, narrow street perspective, black iron railings, vintage street lamps, dark shopfronts, low ambient street light, visible wet-ground reflections. Low-key cinematic lighting, dark exposure, deep blue-black night shadows, warm amber streetlamp key light, strong cool-warm contrast, controlled highlights, stable skin tone, fixed color grade throughout the clip, consistent blue-gray shadows, consistent warm amber practical lights. Directional warm light hits the characters from one side, the opposite side stays in cool shadow, subtle cool rim light on hair and shoulders, background kept darker than the characters, soft bokeh street lamps, realistic film photography, natural motion, restrained facial expressions, 9:16 vertical frame.",
